@page
@model WoodruffDev.Pages.Services.MicroConsultingModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Micro-Consulting";
}

<div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="section-label">Service</span>
        <h1>Micro-Consulting</h1>
        <p>One hour. One problem. Real answers.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="service-detail fade-in">
            <h2>Service Overview</h2>
            <p>Fast, focused sessions to resolve architecture questions, performance issues, or critical forks in the road. Not every problem needs a long engagement. Sometimes you need an experienced architect to look at the problem, give you a direct answer, and get you moving again.</p>

            <h2>When to Book a Micro-Consult</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>You&rsquo;re stuck on an architecture decision and need a second opinion</li>
                <li>Performance is degrading and you need fresh diagnostic eyes</li>
                <li>Your team disagrees on a technical direction and needs an objective voice</li>
                <li>You&rsquo;re evaluating a vendor, tool, or platform and want expert input</li>
                <li>You&rsquo;re preparing for a technical review and need pre-flight coaching</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>How It Works</h2>
            <p>Book a focused session. Share context in advance. I come prepared. You leave with clarity, direction, and (usually) a few things to try right away.</p>

            <div class="service-nav">
                <a href="/Services/ExpertWitness">&larr; Expert Witness</a>
                <a href="/Services/ProjectBased">Project-Based Contracts &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
